      "name": "Coruscation",
      "description": "Stunning, rooting, knocking back or pulling an enemy champion makes it and every enemy champion within 600 of it take 7% more damage for 5s. Getting stunned or rooted yourself does the same to enemy champions within 600 of you (the caster of the CC can't be tracked).",
